  },
  {
    q: 'Which industries hire the most project managers in India?',
    a: 'IT and software delivery hire the highest volume of project manager roles, followed by construction and infrastructure, consulting firms managing client engagements across sectors, and manufacturing or large-scale event delivery. Pay and role structure differ meaningfully by industry, so the right certification and skill focus depend on which one you are targeting.',
